    "summer": "",
    "fall": "",
    "winter": ""
  },
  "funFact": "Members of the Ophiocordycipitaceae family, including this species, are known as 'zombie-ant fungi' because related species can manipulate host insect behavior before killing them, making them fascinating examples of fungal-insect interactions.",
